_modified': '2026-08-24T20:02:08', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 7, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'parent_id': 'b9995de49411665ac9d62b76e47992e3', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'b0008fac57d29125e1f6a8766b452c91'}, page_content='This document describes the Open Antenna Modem Interface Protocol (OpenAMIP™) for satellite terminals. OpenAMIP is an ASCII message-based protocol for the interchange of information between an antenna controller and a satellite modem. OpenAMIP allows the modem to command the controller to seek a particular satellite. OpenAMIP also allows the modem and controller to exchange information necessary to initiate and maintain communications through the satellite.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9430119395256042, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(577.5), np.float64(1676.7424333333338)), (np.float64(577.5), np.float64(1958.4887000000006)), (np.float64(2633.159912109375), np.float64(1958.4887000000006)), (np.float64(2633.159912109375), np.float64(1676.7424333333338))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T20:02:08', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 7, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'parent_id': 'b9995de49411665ac9d62b76e47992e3', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '654b9a8601c516ebfbba3edf672102ba'}, page_content='OpenAMIP is a command set which can be used for various satellite terminal implementations. Not all commands are required for a given implementation and the subset of commands required for a given implementation will be modem/ACU integ