: 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(576.9933471679688), np.float64(543.9151666666667)), (np.float64(576.9933471679688), np.float64(708.9966333333338)), (np.float64(2636.84814453125), np.float64(708.9966333333338)), (np.float64(2636.84814453125), np.float64(543.9151666666667))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T20:02:08', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 48, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'parent_id': '76899f0683ec740bc8c841ff6ed22cd0', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'a2ebf81be7684f8422c2de31c2e200af'}, page_content='This is beyond the scope of OpenAMIP. However, SLIP can be used to establish an IP connection on the serial link. Alternatively, any packet-over-serial technique may be used. (Note that a checksum should be used here.)'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8900660276412964, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(350.0), np.float64(801.9666666666666)), (np.float64(350.0), np.float64(889.4666666666666)), (np.float64(1002.5349731445312), np.float64(889.4666666666666)), (np.float64(1002.5349731445312), np.float64(801.9666666666666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T20:02:08', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 48, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'parent_id': '9d920893e8801656e5f1be56c78d3495', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '564e249a12c70728db7a9b731bd6cb0a'}, page_content='2.7 Semantics'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9419501423835754, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(577.4951583333328), np.float64(928.0401666666666)), (np.float64(577.4951583333328), np.float64(1151.4540333333339)), (np.float64(2634.969482421875), np.float64(1151.4540333333339)), (np.float64(2634.969482421875), np.float64(928.0401666666666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T20:02:08', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 48, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'parent_id': '564e249a12c70728db7a9b731bd6cb0a', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'adf0aacac56abe38bd37cdbb5b4f0068'}, page_content='The protocol is primarily intended to convey state change information based on external events. The following notes are intended to provide functional guidance for various common events and message sequences. It is not intended to be a comprehensive list of messages nor a syntax dictionary.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9510141015052795, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(577.4903166666666), np.float64(1190.156494140625)), (np.float64(577.4903166666666), np.float64(1647.2794333333347)), (np.float64(2637.994873046875), np.float64(1647.2794333333347)), (np.float64(2637.994873046875), np.float64(1190.156494140625))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T20:02:08', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 48, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'parent_id': '564e249a12c70728db7a9b731bd6cb0a', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '5ca55c529e8580ffea0339b27980cc98'}, page_content='To comply with regulatory constraints, the modem must disable its transmitter within 100ms when the antenna loses lock on a satellite, and must also disable the transmitter immediately when a blockage occurs. The antenna must minimize the interval between detecting a change in condition and sending the status message to the modem. Similarly, the antenna may choose to use the modem lock signal as part of its satellite search. The modem must also minimize the interval between detecting the condition and sending the message to the controller. Status changes should be reported within 10ms. However, since this will not be practical on a slow serial link, the links are deprecated.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9428609609603882, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(572.5581665039062), np.float64(1686.3613666666681)), (np.float64(572.5581665039062), np.float64(1909.7752333333349)), (np.float64(2591.5205078125), np.float64(1909.7752333333349)), (np.float64(2591.5205078125), np.float64(1686.3613666666681))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T20:02:08', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 48, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'parent_id': '564e249a12c70728db7a9b731bd6cb0a', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'c1a8ae49ee3a00100e13a9eecb01fa36'}, page_content='Prior to any communication between the modem and the controller, the OpenAMIP state is unspecified. The timers are all set to infinite. The modem initiates communications by sending the commands needed to deliver the satellite parameters to the controller. It then sends an "F" message.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9479967951774597, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(577.4903166666662), np.float64(1948.857166666668)), (np.float64(577.4903166666662), np.float64(2638.9302333333358)), (np.float64(2632.839111328125), np.float64(2638.9302333333358)), (np.float64(2632.839111328125), np.float64(1948.857166666668))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T20:02:08', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 48, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'parent_id': '564e249a12c70728db7a9b731bd6cb0a', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '2072b78c4d7176117eb65dbc18784e60'}, page_content='When the controller receives an "F" message, it must respond within 10 milliseconds with an "s" message. This is necessary to ensure regulatory compliance in the case when the modem needs to mute. The controller must also send a status every "keepalive" interval, and every time the status changes. When the controller responds to an "F" message, the "may transmit" status must reflect the status with respect to the newly-selected satellite parameters. This means that if the modem has just commanded the antenna to "Find" the satellite that it is already tracking and is already locked on, then the immediate status can be "may transmit". However, if the antenna is already tracking a satellite and is successfully locked to it, and the modem then sends new parameters and issues a new "Find" command, the controller must immediately send a status of "must not transmit" because it is not locked to the new satellite (it is locked to the old satellite). After the antenna locks to the new satellite, it will send a new status message indicating that the modem may transmit.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9448544979095459, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(577.4903166666662), np.float64(2678.012166666669)), (np.float64(577.4903166666662), np.float64(2843.0936333333357)), (np.float64(2600.435483333333), np.float64(2843.0936333333357)), (np.float64(2600.435483333333), np.float64(2678.012166666669))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T20:02:08', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 48, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'parent_id': '564e249a12c70728db7a9b731bd6cb0a', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'f26dddc4e553625f8efa7148854c491d'}, page_content='The modem should send an "L" message whenever the modem lock changes. It should also send the "locked" status every time its keepalive timer expires. Whenever the modem sends the "L" message for any reason, it restarts its keepalive timer.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9470623135566711, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(577.490316666666), np.float64(2882.175566666669)), (np.float64(577.490316666666), np.float64(3163.921833333336)), (np.float64(2635.853759765625), np.float64(3163.921833333336)), (np.float64(2635.853759765625), np.float64(2882.175566666669))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T20:02:08', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 48, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'parent_id': '564e249a12c70728db7a9b731bd6cb0a', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '54fa96d777b6d4126588bdb5594b152c'}, page_content='When the modem issues a "W", the controller immediately responds with a "w". The controller responds thereafter every "repeat interval" seconds (zero seconds means never). If the controller sends a "w" to the modem which indicates that the location information is invalid, the controller should send a new "w" message immediately as soon as valid location information becomes available.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9461969137191772, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(576.3582153320312), np.float64(3203.0037666666694)), (np.float64(576.3582153320312), np.float64(3368.085233333336)), (np.float64(2627.44873046875), np.float64(3368.085233333336)), (np.float64(2627.44873046875), np.float64(3203.0037666666694))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T20:02:08', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 48, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'parent_id': '564e249a12c70728db7a9b731bd6cb0a', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '69db2283614bb8af83c86bf99c6390ab'}, page_content='Latitude and longitude are reported in floating point decimal degrees. The range for latitude is -90.0 to 90.0, where -90.0 is the South Pole. The range for longitude is -360.0 to 360.0, where negative is west from the prime meridian and positive is east from the prime meridian.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.27261480689048767, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(350.0), np.float64(3563.6708333333327)), (np.float64(350.0), np.float64(3607.4208333333327)), (np.float64(396.8997497558594), np.float64(3607.4208333333327)), (np.float64(396.8997497558594), np.float64(3563.6708333333327))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T20:02:08', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 48, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'parent_id': '9d920893e8801656e5f1be56c78d3495', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '9bfe856065723aac35ebdb1c2f663cf5'}, page_content='40'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.6833768486976624, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(1946.7926025390625), np.float64(3563.6708333333327)), (np.float64(1946.7926025390625), np.float64(3660.795833333333)), (np.float64(2631.038330078125), np.float64(3660.795833333333)), (np.float64(2631.038330078125), np.float64(3563.6708333333327))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T20:02:08', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 48, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'parent_id': '9bfe856065723aac35ebdb1c2f663cf5', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '5d5717ae4fb3bd2f6dba772903f5bdb9'}, page_content='OpenAMIP™ Standard Version 1.17 T0000682 | Rev H'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8459861874580383, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(2405.1416015625), np.float64(286.37349999999986)), (np.float64(2405.1416015625), np.float64(334.7901666666667)), (np.float64(2628.989013671875), np.float64(334.7901666666667)), (np.float64(2628.989013671875), np.float64(286.37349999999986))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T20:02:08', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 49, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'category': 'Header', 'element_id': '4429ad6f7ef515cd6b2abd1230319c5f'}, page_content='Semantics'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(346.0), np.float64(331.0)), (np.float64(346.0), np.float64(382.0)), (np.float64(793.0), np.float64(382.0)), (np.float64(793.0), np.float64(331.0))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T20:02:08', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 49, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'parent_id': '4429ad6f7ef515cd6b2abd1230319c5f', 'category': 'UncategorizedText', 'element_id': 'a1e6a0010bb454a4ea0bf9bb827fe61e'}, page_content='——_—————————'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.949288010597229, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(577.4999999999998), np.float64(446.79016666666655)), (np.float64(577.4999999999998), np.float64(903.5336333333344)), (np.float64(2649.61279296875), np.float64(903.5336333333344)), (np.float64(2649.61279296875), np.float64(446.79016666666655))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T20:02:08', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 49, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'parent_id': '4429ad6f7ef515cd6b2abd1230319c5f', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'a7ff8af6c5882880cf36dd68180fe665'}, page_content='The overlap is intentional: the sender is free to use zero to 360 or -180 to 180 (or even -360 to 0 or a mixed system). The receiver must be able to handle the full -360 to 360. Leading zeros are optional for the sender, except that the number must have at least one digit before the decimal point. Trailing zeros are optional for the sender, except that the number must have at least one digit after the decimal. The receiver must be able to handle leading and trailing zeros correctly. If the fractional part is zero, the number may be specified as an integer (that is, without a decimal point). Note that the syntax does not permit the use of the "+" character.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9437468647956848, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(577.504841666666), np.float64(942.6155666666677)), (np.float64(577.504841666666), np.float64(1282.6942333333352)), (np.float64(2602.767822265625), np.float64(1282.6942333333352)), (np.float64(2602.767822265625), np.float64(942.6155666666677))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T20:02:08', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 49, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'parent_id': '4429ad6f7ef515cd6b2abd1230319c5f', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '2018e4037340fa545951a48718ddf1d4'}, page_content='The precision of the latitude and longitude is not specified by the OpenAMIP syntax; the number of digits after the decimal point is arbitrary. However, the sender should provide as much precision as is actually available. As a practical matter, OpenAMIP contemplates the ability to use this information for logging and transmission restrictions as mandated by regulatory authorities, so accuracy to about one kilometer is needed: this implies that latitudes and longitudes to a precision of one thousandth of a degree are needed.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9370822310447693, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(577.314453125), np.float64(1321.7761666666686)), (np.float64(577.314453125), np.float64(1486.8576333333356)), (np.float64(2618.838658333332), np.float64(1486.8576333333356)), (np.float64(2618.838658333332), np.float64(1321.7761666666686))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T20:02:08', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 49, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'parent_id': '4429ad6f7ef515cd6b2abd1230319c5f', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '30c08c28336f8afd60a073bebf69a514'}, page_content='If the modem issues a "P", "B", or "F" command that is incompatible with the antenna hardware, the antenna may either ignore the incompatible parts of the command or may set the "functional" status to "not functional" in the \'s\' response.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.947340190410614, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(577.4999999999994), np.float64(1525.939566666669)), (np.float64(577.4999999999994), np.float64(2274.3450333333367)), (np.float64(2645.587890625), np.float64(2274.3450333333367)), (np.float64(2645.587890625), np.float64(1525.939566666669))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T20:02:08', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 49, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'parent_id': '4429ad6f7ef515cd6b2abd1230319c5f', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '93d4fbb1ecd56a28ca604f0c8281cc77'}, page_content='The "K" message conveys the maximum skew of the short axis of a non-circular beam to the geosynchronous arc. If the antenna has a beam shape that is radially symmetric about the bore sight, this parameter may be ignored. Otherwise, the antenna must use the current skew as a factor in computing the "must not transmit" or "may transmit" status. When all other factors permit transmission, the antenna will immediately send a status message with a status of "must not transmit" when the angle transitions from below to above the maximum skew, and will immediately send a status message with a status of "may transmit" when the angle transitions from above to below the maximum skew. In contrast to some other messages, the "K" message takes effect immediately and the modem may send a new "K" message with a new max skew angle at any time. The "K" message also includes a minimum skew parameter, to support protection of non-geostationary satellites. The minimum skew parameter operates analogously to the maximum skew parameter; the antenna controller should send a status of "must not transmit" when the skew is less than this value.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9432401061058044, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(577.4999999999995), np.float64(2313.42696666667)), (np.float64(577.4999999999995), np.float64(2653.505633333337)), (np.float64(2638.678955078125), np.float64(2653.505633333337)), (np.float64(2638.678955078125), np.float64(2313.42696666667))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T20:02:08', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 49, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'parent_id': '4429ad6f7ef515cd6b2abd1230319c5f', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '69aba48686f90815b7f798015674fd26'}, page_content='When the antenna reports with an "s" message that the antenna is functional, it indicates that the antenna should currently be working. "Non-functional" means that the antenna is not currently in service. This does not include blockage, loss of lock, system initialization, loss of heading information, cable unwrap, or any condition that can correct itself without intervention. It does include detection of a fatal mechanical failure, or an operator command to the antenna controller from its front panel or other source, or an illegal configuration.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9421632289886475, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(577.4999999999998), np.float64(2692.58756666667)), (np.float64(577.4999999999998), np.float64(3032.6662333333375)), (np.float64(2637.651611328125), np.float64(3032.6662333333375)), (np.float64(2637.651611328125), np.float64(2692.58756666667))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T20:02:08', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 49, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'parent_id': '4429ad6f7ef515cd6b2abd1230319c5f', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '27f67c7cd23c7cd3f613c4c0c830a10f'}, page_content='When the modem detects this status, it will not attempt to recover by, for example, switching to a different satellite or clearing and re-establishing the OpenAMIP connection. The modem waits until the antenna sends a "functional" message. The antenna provides a "may transmit" when it is locked on the satellite and ready to transmit. The antenna signals "must not transmit" if there is any reason the modem should not transmit: blockage, loss of lock, cable unwrap, sea too rough, and so on.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.7476257085800171, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(346.82891845703125), np.float64(3563.2734375)), (np.float64(346.82891845703125), np.float64(3660.795833333333)), (np.float64(1033.117919921875), np.float64(3660.795833333333)), (np.float64(1033.117919921875), np.float64(3563.2734375))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T20:02:08', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 49, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'parent_id': '4429ad6f7ef515cd6b2abd1230319c5f', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'acf8598ab5fa3e80d84d9f72db31a325'}, page_content='OpenAMIP™ Standard Version 1.17 T0000682 | Rev H'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.26680776476860046, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(2579.206875), np.float64(3563.65576171875)), (np.float64(2579.206875), np.float64(3607.4208333333327)), (np.float64(2625.2919921875), np.float64(3607.4208333333327)), (np.floa