'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9256047606468201, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(569.7889404296875), np.float64(1406.86376953125)), (np.float64(569.7889404296875), np.float64(2806.95166015625)), (np.float64(2653.001708984375), np.float64(2806.95166015625)), (np.float64(2653.001708984375), np.float64(1406.86376953125))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T20:02:08', 'text_as_html': '<table><tbody><tr><td>A</td><td>August 4, 2015 Date</td><td>° Updates First release of the OpenAMIP Standard (version 1.8) document in iDirect Technical Publications template. For changes from version 1.7 to 1.8, see Modified OpenAMIP on page 48. The time parameter of the w command is now made mandatory.</td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td>See Message Types, Sender (M) on page 5.</td></tr><tr><td>eo</td><td>October 12, 2016</td><td>Updated to OpenAMIP Standard version 1.9 to 1.12.</td></tr><tr><td>C co</td><td>November 1, 2016</td><td>Updated “w, W, H, and C” type message descriptions.</td></tr><tr><td></td><td>September 8, 2017</td><td>Here are the changes from version 1.12 to 1.16: Time is now always accepted as float. New reserved parameters in "N" and "s" messages. New parameter in "s" message for detailed enumerated status code. New reserved parameter in "F" message and new reserved "f" message. Reason Code = 0 should be used when the modem may transmit. Added a note about optional parameters in 2.1. Added an example of \'s\' in a blockage zone in 2.6.2. Deleted Section 3.1.1; it was redundant with the Revision History.</td></tr></tbody></table>', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 3, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'parent_id': '7464ddd56e551bad4145ecc2ad18a1c3', 'category': 'Table', 'element_id': 'ffa63a68a8dfcc40566ea9c41d775bea', 'is_table_fragment': False}, page_content='<table><tbody><tr><td>A</td><td>August 4, 2015 Date</td><td>° Updates First release of the OpenAMIP Standard (version 1.8) document in iDirect Technical Publications template. For changes from version 1.7 to 1.8, see Modified OpenAMIP on page 48. The time parameter of the w command is now made mandatory.</td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td>See Message Types, Sender (M) on page 5.</td></tr><tr><td>eo</td><td>October 12, 2016</td><td>Updated to OpenAMIP Standard version 1.9 to 1.12.</td></tr><tr><td>C co</td><td>November 1, 2016</td><td>Updated “w, W, H, and C” type message descriptions.</td></tr><tr><td></td><td>September 8, 2017</td><td>Here are the changes from version 1.12 to 1.16: Time is now always accepted as float. New reserved parameters in "N" and "s" messages. New parameter in "s" message for detailed enumerated status code. New reserved parameter in "F" message and new reserved "f" message. Reason Code = 0 should be used when the modem may transmit. Added a note about optional parameters in 2.1. Added an example of \'s\' in a blockage zone in 2.6.2. Deleted Section 3.1.1; it was redundant with the Revision History.</td></tr></tbody></table>'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9175359010696411, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(543.371337890625), np.float64(449.02410888671875)), (np.float64(543.371337890625), np.float64(1702.8546142578125)), (np.float64(2666.48388671875), np.float64(1702.8546142578125)), (np.float64(2666.48388671875), np.float64(449.02410888671875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T20:02:08', 'text_as_html': '<table><tbody><tr><td>enhancements: Significant new commands and modifications to existing commands Modem commands extended with new parameters: B, F, H, |, L, M, N, P, S, T, V, W, Y New Modem commands: G, O, R Message Types, Sender (M) on page 5 Antenna commands extended with new parameters: i, s, V, W, y New Antenna commands: g Message Types, Sender (A) on page 24 Added new status codes: e Antenna Status Codes on page 37</td></tr><tr><td>Updated description of F message to describe behavior on a TLE update containing no change in the tracking satellite. e Updated description of | message - replaced Inclined Orbit (10) with Geosynchronous Inclined Orbit (GIO). e Updated description of O message to describe behavior on a TLE update containing no change in the tracking satellite.</td></tr></tbody></table>', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 4, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'parent_id': '402c6b0ef931fc239082feac5da0273e', 'category': 'Table', 'element_id': '4476800140cb07aaa63c398007b42a36', 'is_table_fragment': False}, page_content='<table><tbody><tr><td>enhancements: Significant new commands and modifications to existing commands Modem commands extended with new parameters: B, F, H, |, L, M, N, P, S, T, V, W, Y New Modem commands: G, O, R Message Types, Sender (M) on page 5 Antenna commands extended with new parameters: i, s, V, W, y New Antenna commands: g Message Types, Sender (A) on page 24 Added new status codes: e Antenna Status Codes on page 37</td></tr><tr><td>Updated description of F message to describe behavior on a TLE update containing no change in the tracking satellite. e Updated description of | message - replaced Inclined Orbit (10) with Geosynchronous Inclined Orbit (GIO). e Updated description of O message to describe behavior on a TLE update containing no change in the tracking satellite.</td></tr></tbody></table>'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp800