7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'parent_id': '8599a88f725c4f89593544c9c9b96caa', 'category': 'Table', 'element_id': 'ab84c4a0a74cfaa4326fc02981e1ee92', 'is_table_fragment': False}, page_content='<table><thead><tr><th>ype</th><th>Description</th><th>No. of Parameter(s)</th><th>Name of the Parameters</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td></td><td>Supported OpenAMIP commands are explicitly</td><td>0</td><td>char command</td></tr><tr><td></td><td>indicates by a series of key, value pairs which commands are supported, and up to how many parameters are</td><td></td><td>int parameters supported</td></tr></tbody></table>'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.5263770222663879, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(553.87451171875), np.float64(669.7988891601562)), (np.float64(553.87451171875), np.float64(2917.372802734375)), (np.float64(2623.068603515625), np.float64(2917.372802734375)), (np.float64(2623.068603515625), np.float64(669.7988891601562))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2975, 'layout_height': 3850}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T20:02:08', 'text_as_html': '<table><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>__— Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>0</td><td>Modem May Transmit - No problems detected.</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>Cable Unwrap - Antenna has reached its Azimuth motion limit and is performing an azimuth move away from the limit; no longer tracking the satellite.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Blockage Zone - The Antenna is tracking in a Blockage Zone defined for the vessel where obstructions can inhibit or degrade satellite communication.</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>RF Hazard Zone - The Antenna is tracking in a No Transmit area defined for the vessel for RF radiation hazard reasons.</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Sidelobe Check - The Antenna is performing a search pattern to determine if it is has peaked the RF signal on the main beam or the sidelobe.</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Elevation Limit - The Antenna is tracking above or below the specified elevation limits for the system.</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>AZ/SKEW Limit - The Antenna is tracking and the Azimuth or Skew Pointing Error exceeds the transmit limit indicating it may be mispointed (primarily for keyhole tracking).</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>Gyro Cap - The Antenna is tracking and the Azimuth or Elevation acceleration exceeds the transmit limit indicating it may be mispointed.</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>Ant Search State - The Antenna is commanded to go to a new satellite and is searching for that satellite.</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>RSSI Below Threshold - The Antenna is tracking and it detects that the RSSI has fallen below RSSI valid threshold for a duration of time as dictated by FCC regulations.</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>Initializing - The Antenna boots up or gets restarted and is in its initialization process.</td></tr><tr><td>11</td><td>LNB Voltage Error</td></tr><tr><td>12</td><td>BUC Voltage Error</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>RF Configuration Error</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>RF Communication Error</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>On Ground (aircraft is prohibited from transmitting)</td></tr><tr><td>16</td><td>Geographic Restriction for regulatory reasons</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>HW Mute Switch (for example, for safety interlock).</td></tr></tbody></table>', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 45, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_d9819300d88ddfd3ced0bb7e3d1398ac.pdf', 'parent_id': '91f4eb163d9b73816258936d5b7123dc', 'category': 'Table', 'element_id': '3c75bceeb20dbef7dad44c4a8cfe3ad7', 'is_table_fragment': False}, page_content='<table><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>__— Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>0</td><td>Modem May Transmit - No problems detected.</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>Cable Unwrap - Antenna has reached its Azimuth motion limit 